{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10173","headline":"登湓城浦望庐山初晴直省齎敕催赴江阴 · 李嘉佑","name":"登湓城浦望庐山初晴直省齎敕催赴江阴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西望香炉雪，千峰晚色新。\n白头悲作吏，黄纸苦催人。\n多负登山屐，深藏漉酒巾。\n伤心公府内，手板日相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}